{"_v":3,"id":"i-became-we-off-broadway-2026","cat":"off-broadway","cs":83.96,"rc":7,"bd":{"positive":5,"mixed":2,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Helen Shaw","o":"The New York Times","s":90,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/28/theater/i-became-we-review-mona-pirnot.html","d":"2026-10-28","q":"The production is also consistently, ecstatically gorgeous.","dg":"Critics_Pick","tc":1},{"cn":"Howard Miller","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":84,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.talkinbroadway.com/page/ob/10_27_26.html","d":"2026-10-27","q":"This is a show that is sure to have legs down the road, with a wide appeal to choirmasters looking for something original for their singers to perform."},{"cn":"Michael Sommers","o":"New York Stage Review","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://nystagereview.com/2026/10/27/i-became-we-modern-married-life/","d":"2026-10-27","q":"A sophisticated chamber musical of this quality is a rare event and should be grabbed with both hands."},{"cn":"Caroline Cao","o":"New York Theatre Guide","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.newyorktheatreguide.com/reviews/i-became-we-off-broadway-review","d":"2026-10-27","q":"It’s a moving 70 minutes on the uncertainties that can orbit a life."},{"cn":"Kenji Fujishima","o":"TheaterMania","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.theatermania.com/news/review-i-became-we-is-a-musical-monologue-about-thoughts-of-motherhood_1858228/","d":"2026-10-27","q":"In a show that offers a brilliant demonstration of the power of music to make deeply personal feelings broadly accessible, this moment carries the force of a universal epiphany."},{"cn":"Thom Geier","o":"Culture Sauce","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://culturesauce.com/i-became-we-off-broadway-review/","d":"2026-10-27","q":"I Became We is a singular achievement, a choral masterpiece that is thoughtful, smart, funny, and frankly unforgettable."},{"cn":"Kendra Jones","o":"Front Row Center","s":90,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://thefrontrowcenter.com/2026/10/i-became-we/","d":"2026-10-27","q":"I Became We is one of the best plays I've experienced this season–the writing hits all the notes I could ever ask to feel in a single hour."}],"au":{"score":89.27,"designation":"Loving","sources":{"ss":{"s":92,"c":39,"u":"https://www.show-score.com/off-broadway-shows/i-became-we"},"mz":{"s":85,"c":25,"sr":4.3},"rd":{"s":94,"c":7,"tp":1,"sent":{"enthusiastic":0.43,"positive":0.43,"mixed":0.14,"negative":0,"neutral":0}}}},"cn":{"t":"Pirnot's innovative autofiction piece charms critics with its unconventional format—a 16-person choir performing 33 songs exploring marriage and motherhood. The intimate 70-minute work delights with humor, emotional resonance, and Coen's evocative score.","rc":7},"sh":{"wk":"20261116","days":[{"m":null,"e":null},{"m":null,"e":"19:00"},{"m":"14:00","e":"19:00"},{"m":null,"e":"19:00"},{"m":null,"e":"19:00"},{"m":"14:00","e":"19:00"},{"m":"14:00","e":null}]},"pd":"2026-10-16","ca":[{"n":"Alison Cheeseman","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Paul Chew MinChul","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Oliver Holt","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Heather Jones","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Helen Karloski","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Chad Kranak","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Katie McCreary","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Neil Netherly","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Logan Pitts","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Carrie Quarquesso","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"AnnMarie Sandy","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Michael Steinberger","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Gergorio Taniguchi","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Tyler Tejada","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Elizabeth van Os","r":"Choir Member"},{"n":"Jen Wu","r":"Choir Member"}],"cov":{"state":"incomplete","liveCount":5,"candidateCount":7,"computedAt":"2026-10-30T06:43:10.293Z"}}